  "description": "The MonoGame 3.8.6.1 Content Builder (MGCB) command line tool, built from BorrowedTorch's fork with compute (cpt-max's): its effects are MGFX 100, with compute, hull, domain and geometry shaders, the format BorrowedTorch.MonoGame.Framework.Compute.WindowsDX reads. Run as dotnet mgcb-bt; BorrowedTorch.MonoGame.Content.Builder.Task.Compute runs it at build. Built and checked on Windows, for the WindowsDX platform.",
